mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">京东发布并开源可交互视听世界模型EchoWM，JoyAI-Echo1.5实现10分钟长视频生成</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI完成Grok 4.8模型训练，参数量达2.5万亿并采用全新C++软件栈</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布关停GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark模型，下周正式退役</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软在Microsoft 365 Copilot中正式集成SpaceXAI Grok模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6cac54587de973a64b1801adb05b2d26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于9月12日宣布，正式在Microsoft 365 Copilot中引入SpaceXAI的Grok模型，该模型已在Word、Excel和PowerPoint中上线。此次集成作为Microsoft Frontier项目的一部分，目前向特定客户开放有限预览，旨在评估Grok在办公场景的实际效能。这是微软继引入Anthropic Claude系列后，进一步深化多模型架构、摆脱单一模型依赖的关键举措。在合规性方面，SpaceXAI已被纳入微软在线服务子处理器列表，企业IT管理员需显式开启功能方可访问，并拥有完整的数据处理控制权。需注意，预览期内该服务暂不向欧盟、欧洲自由贸易联盟国家及英国的Frontier用户开放。微软已对Grok完成负责任AI审核与安全验证，此举标志着企业级AI正加速向多元模型并存的生态演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布豆包手机助手消费者版，支持指纹唤醒与跨应用Agent自动执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a66c70e0228eccd53173e2b9874f772c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正式发布豆包手机助手消费者版，通过整合AI键、本地记忆与跨应用Agent技术，推动手机AI从问答向自动办事演进。交互方面，AI键支持指纹锁屏一键唤醒，并支持语音连续对话与屏幕识别功能。记忆能力上，助手经授权可检索相册、短信等本地数据，并接入飞书妙记实现办公场景下的录音转写与总结。Agent执行层面，该版本支持模拟点击与工具调用，覆盖电商比价、出行服务等场景，并支持多任务排队与锁屏进度查看。安全方面，采用端云结合处理，引入SAEP协议进行分层分级管理，已获ISO27001、27701、42001及等保三级认证。目前该助手延续与中兴、努比亚的合作适配。业内分析认为，该版本将系统权限、记忆与自动执行深度串联，有望成为核心AI入口，但第三方应用稳定性与敏感操作授权仍是行业面临的挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">京东发布并开源可交互视听世界模型EchoWM，JoyAI-Echo1.5实现10分钟长视频生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0c5f55c8a7ee81612328c89ec9b1008d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">京东在JDD大会上发布并开源可交互视听世界模型EchoWM，同时推出JoyAI-Echo1.5音视频生成模型。EchoWM通过原生联合生成720P视频与音效，支持第一人称导航及多轮连续探索，在WBench Navigation评测中位列第一。JoyAI-Echo1.5采用音视频Memory Bank架构，实现10分钟以上长视频持续生成，在2张H200 GPU支持下，480P分辨率下可达24fps的1:1等时生成速度，并配备Director Agent负责分镜规划与成片组装。此外，京东预告将于10月发布强化商业视频生成与物理规律呈现的JoyAI-Video模型。京东此次还展示了涵盖零售、物流、医疗、工业及政务五大领域的行业模型与智能体，旨在推动AI从数字内容生成向动态环境感知与具身智能演练演进，构建从真实数据到模</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI完成Grok 4.8模型训练，参数量达2.5万亿并采用全新C++软件栈</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI首席执行官埃隆·马斯克宣布，Grok 4.8模型将于本周完成训练，随后正式进入强化学习阶段。该模型参数量达到2.5万亿，且在训练过程中采用了全新的C++软件栈。此前，Grok 4.7的发布曾因强化学习阶段的回复长度惩罚问题出现延期，模型在处理复杂任务时表现出过早放弃及缺乏自我回查能力，此次Grok 4.8的训练旨在解决此类技术瓶颈。随着2.5万亿参数规模的达成，xAI通过底层软件栈的重构，进一步提升了模型在复杂逻辑推理与任务执行中的表现，这对大模型训练效率及推理能力的优化具有重要行业参考意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布关停GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark模型，下周正式退役</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI Codex负责人Tibo宣布，史上最快模型GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark将于下周正式退役。该模型于今年2月12日发布，存续期仅7个月。作为OpenAI首个脱离英伟达技术栈、运行在Cerebras WSE-3晶圆级芯片上的生产模型，Spark曾以每秒1200 Token的极速主打实时编程。然而，其本质为“蒸馏版小模型”，在Terminal-Bench 2.0评测中准确率仅58.4%，远低于完整版GPT-5.3-Codex的77.3%，开发者反馈存在API捏造及JSON格式不稳定问题。随着8月13日Cerebras推出Ultrafast模式，旗舰模型GPT-5.6 Sol已能在保持高智能的同时实现极速推理，导致Spark因用量下滑被淘汰。此次关停标志着OpenAI模型策略的转变：速度不再由专用</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
